# Title: AD Privileged Users or Groups Reconnaissance
# ID: 35ba1d85-724d-42a3-889f-2e2362bcaf23
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Samir Bousseaden
# Date: 2019-04-03
# Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1087.002
# Description: Detect priv users or groups recon based on 4661 eventid and known privileged users or groups SIDs
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((winlog.event_id:"4661" AND (ObjectType:"SAM_USER" OR ObjectType:"SAM_GROUP")) AND (((ObjectName:*-512 OR ObjectName:*-502 OR ObjectName:*-500 OR ObjectName:*-505 OR ObjectName:*-519 OR ObjectName:*-520 OR ObjectName:*-544 OR ObjectName:*-551 OR ObjectName:*-555)) OR (ObjectName:*admin*)) AND NOT ((SubjectUserName:*$)))
